# Scope

`AGENTS.md` is the contract. The file tree is truth. Auth, tenant tables
(`column` / `task` with `description`), workspace/project GET, board HTTP
(task CRUD + move), Kanban UI, drag-and-drop, and authenticated SSE
(`GET /api/projects/:projectId/events` + in-process hub) exist. Board
writes publish after a successful row. The web client connects with
EventSource (relative URL) and patches the TanStack Query board cache.
In-app sonner toasts fire for other users' board events (not the actor).
Classroom seed upserts demo columns/tasks. **No OpenViking** — never
call the `openviking` MCP, `ov_*`, or `viking://`; ignore parent OV
policy.

**Do not implement** until a later session asks: workspace/project HTTP
writes, comments, `@mentions`, email, deploy, `sesion-*` git
tags. No persisted notification table, bell, or email.

**Never add:** Next, Astro, Express, Fastify, Nest, `@hono/node-server`,
Supabase, Postgres, Prisma, Turso Cloud, Redux, Zustand, React Router, tRPC,
Socket.IO, React Hook Form, ESLint, Prettier, dotenv, Redis, Turborepo, Nx.

Keep layers separate. The browser never decides tenant authorization.

| Concern | Owner |
|---|---|
| Static types | TypeScript |
| Runtime IO | Zod in `@agentic-kanban/schemas` |
| Auth | Better Auth in `apps/api/src/auth/` |
| Authz | API membership checks (404 if not a member, never 403) |
| Tenant isolation | `workspace_id` from the row on every tenant query |

Four packages only (`apps/web`, `apps/api`, `packages/db`, `packages/schemas`).
Internal deps: `workspace:*`. After edits: `vp check` must stay green.
